//! Comparison of the IRC parts with MultiOptPy 1.21.2 where its result does not depend on
//! an error that mopt-rs does not repeat (tests/golden/irc_parts.json, generated by
//! tools/golden/irc_reference.py): the LQA step, the distance-weighted interpolant and its
//! corrector, and a whole RK4 run.
//!
//! MultiOptPy: `IRC/lqa.py:LQA.step`, `IRC/hpc.py:DWISurface`, `IRC/hpc.py:corrector_step`,
//! `IRC/rk4.py:RK4`.
//!
